  unitName: Tidal Dragoon Zephu
  unitId: 20025
  unitNumber: 793
  description: A dragoon who protected the royal family of the Sama Kingdom until
    the very end during the great war with the gods. Zephu, who continued to fight
    even after having rescued Prince Arius, fought so arduously that both his soul
    and his body began fusing with those of his dragon. His beloved lance went through
    the same transformation, and under the new name "Ice Dragon," became an extension
    of Zephu's own body. However, Zephu knew that the more he strained both his mind
    and body, the closer it would bring him to his death.
  summonDesc: I am a knight.<br>Once I pledge myself to you,<br>I shall follow you
    to the end.
  fusionDesc: In my current state,<br>I can muster unlimited power.<br>If my body
    can take it, that is...
  evoDesc: I'm neither a human, nor a dragon.<br>I am both human and dragon.<br>Do
    you understand that?
